# The tables are NOT in this repository any more.
#
# Until v1.3.0 the Parquet files were committed and the CSVs were attached to
# releases, which meant anyone could take the whole corpus without asking. From
# v2.0.0 the tables live in a private R2 bucket behind the API: browsing is
# capped at 100 rows a request and whole tables need a free key. Committing a
# table here would undo all of that in one push, so they are ignored, and the
# Pages workflow fails the build if one ever reaches the site.
#
# data/manifest.json and data/schema.json stay tracked: they document the
# release and contain no data.
data/*.parquet
data/*.csv
data/*.gz
data2/

# Generated import files and aggregates for the API (149 MB of SQL).
api/build/
d1/

# Intermediate export output
scripts/__pycache__/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Never commit a Cloudflare token or an API key.
.dev.vars
.env
*.key
wrangler.toml.local
.wrangler/

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
r-package/..Rcheck/
r-package/*.tar.gz

# OS
.DS_Store
